 *   **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of raymarch steps [S1, unofficial]. Each step involves an SDF query [S1, unofficial].
 *   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ per ray, plus storage for the SDF texture [S1, unofficial].
